## 2.4 Secure access token storage

Create a dedicated server-side Shopify credential storage abstraction.

Use the existing database and repository architecture.

Implement encryption at rest using authenticated encryption such as AES-256-GCM.

Encryption keys must come from environment secrets, never from frontend code or source control.

Requirements:

- Store encrypted access tokens.
- Store encrypted refresh tokens when provided.
- Store key version metadata to support future key rotation.
- Store Shopify shop domain and granted scopes.
- Store token expiration timestamps.
- Store connection status.
- Store workspace ownership.
