Do not expose token values through API responses.

Do not include secrets in application diagnostics.

Handle missing encryption configuration as a secure configuration error. Never silently fall back to plaintext storage.

Ensure one workspace cannot access another workspace's Shopify credentials.

Ensure unique shop installation behavior is explicitly designed and tested.

